Bind Npc 24426 Zone 71 for karus
Bind Npc 14426 Zone 71 for elmorad
Quest 356 "Patriarch's Followers"
    Journal for karus "The 4 Patriarchs are the biggest threats in Ronark Land! Get rid of their followers!!"
    Journal for elmorad "The 4 Patriarchs are the biggest threats in Ronark Land! Get rid of their followers!!"
    Kill 40 of 8407
    Kill 40 of 8405
    Kill 40 of 8406

Requires player level >= 74

Rewards
    Give 250000000 experience

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Master, Ronark Land seems to have many enemies posing threat. Let's look for [Outpost Captain] Elrod."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Master, Ronark Land seems to have many enemies posing threat. Let's look for [Outpost Captain] Della."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "It feels as if I am sitting on a bed of nails, with all these enemies suddenly appearing from nowhere to threaten Ronark Land and there is not one we can take lightly..."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "The biggest threats to Ronark Land are the four Patriarchs, and their followers..."

On ready
    Say "I think we've more or less completed the expedition mission, with this."
    Topic "Confirm" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Have you dealt with all those followers of Patriarchs?! Wow~"

On completed
    Say "Since we lack the strength to defeat them ourselves, I am thinking of requesting for reinforcements. What do you think? Well.."
